      "authority_type": "opinion",
      "citation": "Quincy Communication v. Patrick, 2021-Ohio-1736, ¶ 10",
      "text": "The elements of a breach-of-contract claim are a contract, the plaintiff’s performance, a breach by the defendant, and damages. White v. Pitman , 2020-Ohio-3957, 156 N.E.3d 1026, ¶ 37 (1st Dist.).",
      "text_sha256": "9cd9811d4a8e341c5ed9c2c4f366c9b8b9b2aa93be5b068fc74ec6df47e3539c",
